msgid "Pergel"
msgstr ""

msgid "Read the patterns, pages, design tokens and settings of a site built with Pergel."
msgstr ""

msgid "List Pergel patterns"
msgstr ""

msgid "Lists the Pergel patterns a page can be built from, with their categories and the fields a project package fills in them."
msgstr ""

msgid "Optional: only patterns in this category, like banner or pergel-faq."
msgstr ""

msgid "Get the fields of a Pergel pattern"
msgstr ""

msgid "Returns the fields of one Pergel pattern with their types and sample values, and a section of a project package content file that uses them."
msgstr ""

msgid "Pattern name, like hero-split."
msgstr ""

msgid "List pages and their sections"
msgstr ""

msgid "Lists the pages in menu order with their address, template and status, the patterns their sections were made from, and the project package that made them."
msgstr ""

msgid "Get the design tokens"
msgstr ""

msgid "Returns the design tokens of the active theme (colors, fonts, spacing, radius, shadows): the Pergel theme's, merged with what a child theme changes. A project package writes such changes in brand/tokens.json."
msgstr ""

msgid "Get the Pergel settings"
msgstr ""

msgid "Returns the settings under Pergel → Settings by group: the module switches, the brand details, SEO, performance, forms, search and shop."
msgstr ""

