msgid "Modules"
msgstr ""

msgid "Switch off what this site does not use. A switched-off module loads no code."
msgstr ""

msgid "Brand"
msgstr ""

msgid "Company details, entered once. Blocks show them through the Pergel Brand source, and search engines receive them as Organization data."
msgstr ""

msgid "SEO"
msgstr ""

msgid "Used only while no SEO plugin is active. With Rank Math, Yoast SEO, All in One SEO, SEOPress or The SEO Framework, Pergel hands over and only adds the brand details to its data."
msgstr ""

msgid "Performance"
msgstr ""

msgid "Front-end changes made while the Performance module is on. The admin area is not affected."
msgstr ""

msgid "Forms"
msgstr ""

msgid "Where the messages from the Form block go. Every message is also kept under Pergel → Form messages, so none is lost when an email does not arrive."
msgstr ""

msgid "Search"
msgstr ""

msgid "Pergel keeps its own search index: it finds words as you type them, with or without Turkish letters and accents, and ranks titles, SKUs and categories above the text. It is updated whenever content is saved."
msgstr ""

msgid "Shop"
msgstr ""

msgid "How Pergel works with WooCommerce. This tab is shown while WooCommerce is active."
msgstr ""

msgid "Shop layout"
msgstr ""

msgid "How the shop, product category, product tag and product search pages list products. A product category can choose its own layout on its edit screen; its subcategories follow it. \"As in the template\" and \"Automatic\" keep the layout of the theme template."
msgstr ""

msgid "General"
msgstr ""

msgid "How Pergel works with WooCommerce: selling, product enquiries, the wishlist and compare lists, and speed."
msgstr ""

msgid "Header"
msgstr ""

msgid "The top of every page: the cart in the theme headers, or a store header with a top bar, a product search and a menu bar."
msgstr ""

msgid "Shop page"
msgstr ""

msgid "Filters"
msgstr ""

msgid "The filters beside the products on the shop and category pages."
msgstr ""

msgid "Product cards"
msgstr ""

msgid "The cards of every product grid: the shop, categories, related products and the grids on other pages."
msgstr ""

msgid "Product page"
msgstr ""

msgid "The top of the product page: the pictures, the details beside them and buying. A product category and a product can choose some of these for themselves."
msgstr ""

msgid "Under the product"
msgstr ""

msgid "The description, specifications, questions and reviews under the product, then related and recently viewed products."
msgstr ""

msgid "Flash sales"
msgstr ""

msgid "Campaigns with a start and an end, under Products → Flash sales."
msgstr ""

msgid "Delivery and shipping"
msgstr ""

msgid "The delivery date estimate and the free shipping progress."
msgstr ""

msgid "Bar on phones"
msgstr ""

msgid "The bar at the bottom of the screen on phones."
msgstr ""

msgid "Ready-made layouts"
msgstr ""

msgid "Set many shop settings in one go. You see every change before it is made, and can undo it."
msgstr ""

